---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Appearances" description="Podcasts and other appearances" ogImage="/images/og/og-appearances.png">
  <div class="appearances-page">
    <h1 class="page-title">Appearances</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      Podcasts, interviews, and a few places where my work has shown up outside the site itself.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-heading">AI and the environment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/2E3Yfi24OUyHxz67BtzhHB?si=8110a29fe7034cf5">Conspicuous Cognition</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/1Lzt9pMcqOcjfE3WLxNy3j?si=fdb4604af43d40e9">Chain of Thought</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0UaOQ0DcP9c8OG5IfAgfnT?si=5d00e4bce6aa43f0">NYT Hard Fork</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0RBBVeGb5yfHsFWnKkDgD0?si=15d8b610374544b0">The Cognitive Revolution</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Ird91qfPZs">Good Morning America</a>
        <ul>
          <li>I show up for about 5 seconds in this segment to say data centers run and store what we do online.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li><a href="https://www.azfamily.com/2026/02/26/data-centers-arent-water-villains-you-think-they-are-environmentalist-says/">Arizona's Family</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FQCdwcW3wEw">David Ramms</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="section-heading">Effective altruism</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzNZfa2jSE8">Expected Volume</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://benthams.substack.com/p/chatting-with-andy-masley-about-ea">Bentham's Bulldog</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.machineculture.io/p/model-convo-andy-masley">Model Convos</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QNQezP5uzeg">The World Can Be Better</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .appearances-page {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .page-intro {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  li ul {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  li ul li {
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
